Scope
-----

This license covers the source code of this repository and the documentation
written for it. It does not, and cannot, change the terms of material that came
from elsewhere:

- The fingering engine in `python-core/handthesia_core` and its TypeScript port
  in `packages/engine-ts` are derived from V9011N's Hand-thesia
  (https://github.com/V9011N/pygame-piano-animator), which is published without
  a license. That part remains under its author's terms; obtain V9011N's
  permission before redistributing it. See "Credits" in README.md.

- Third-party components keep their own licenses: MuseScore General v0.2 (MIT),
  Pyodide (MPL-2.0), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), pretty-midi and mido (MIT), PixiJS
  and Three.js (MIT), Mediabunny (MPL-2.0), hash-wasm (MIT), Signalsmith
  Stretch (MIT), React, Radix UI and Lucide. Notices live in
  `apps/client/public/notices/` and `docs/licenses/`.

- Bundled media is not relicensed here: the MIDI files in `builtin_melodies/`
  and the hand textures and models in `apps/client/public/` have no recorded
  provenance and are not cleared for redistribution.

If you contribute to this repository, you agree that your contributions are
licensed under the same terms.
